Write a program to compute the following for a given network 
a. Number of edges 
b. Number of vertices 
c. Degree of nodes 
d. Node with the lowest Degree 
e. Adjacency Matrix 

Code:
library(‘igraph’) 
g = graph.formula(1-2, 1-3, 2-3, 2-4, 2-5, 4-5, 4-6, 4-7, 5-6, 6-7)
plot(g) 
ecount(g) 
vcount(g) 
V(g)$name[degree(g) == min(degree(g))]
V(g)$name[degree(g) == max(degree(g))]
get.adjacency(g) 
get.adjedgelist(g) 
